@startuml Onboarding_Sequence
title RubyGYM - Member Onboarding (metrics + plan + trainer)

actor Member
participant "Frontend" as FE
participant "Backend" as BE
database "MySQL" as DB

Member -> FE: Open onboarding after first login
FE -> BE: GET /api/members/me/onboarding
BE -> DB: SELECT member, latest subscription, trainers
DB --> BE: data
BE --> FE: {completed, missing_steps:[PROFILE_METRICS, SUBSCRIPTION], trainers}
note over FE, BE
ADR-002: onboarding scope = body metrics + plan + trainer.
Training goal is NOT part of onboarding.
end note

Member -> FE: Enter weight, height, plan, trainer preference
FE -> BE: PUT /api/members/me/onboarding\n{current_weight, height_cm, trainer_id, plan_type, start_date}
BE -> BE: Validate metrics ranges + plan type
BE -> DB: UPDATE members SET trainer_id, current_weight, height_cm
BE -> DB: INSERT/UPDATE subscriptions (compute end_date + bonuses)
note right of BE
No write to training_goals here.
end note
BE --> FE: 200 {completed:true, subscription}
FE --> Member: Redirect to dashboard + hint to set goal
@enduml
